== Effect ==
* Spawns a familiar who drops a {{e|Half Red Heart}} every three rooms.
** The first drop happens after two rooms.

== Notes ==
* Little C.H.A.D. can drop by defeating {{e|C.H.A.D.}}
* {{dlc|r}} [[Familiar]]s that follow behind Isaac have a certain priority in how close their position is to him over other familiars, with Little C.H.A.D. having the lowest priority at {{dlc|nr+}} 6th / {{dlc|r+}} 8th and thus being farther from Isaac than familiars of different priorities.

== Synergies ==
* {{i|BFFS!}}: The familiar drops hearts in a repeating pattern of 2, 2 then 3 rooms.

== Interactions ==
* {{C|???}}, {{C|Tainted ???|r}}, {{dlc|r}}{{C|Black Judas|dlc=r}}, {{C|Tainted Judas|r}}, {{C|Tainted Forgotten|r}}: Useless, unless {{t|Apple of Sodom}} or {{i|Dark Bum}} have been collected, since these characters can't pick up red hearts.
* {{C|Keeper}}/{{C|Tainted Keeper}}: Will give [[Familiar#Blue Flies|Blue Flies]] instead of hearts, acting as a weaker {{i|Rotten Baby}}.

